# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout and the GitHub/Cloudflare builds agree (stops the whole-file CRLF diffs).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
